  "familyConfig": {
    "categoryEncoding": {
      "description": "How the four category bytes at 0x18-0x1B of a voice's documented Voice Common block encode the two assignments (MIDI_Data_Table_en.xls, VOICE NORMAL r26-r29; the Common block is 0x40 00 00 for a Normal Voice and 0x46 00 00 for a Drum Voice). Each assignment is a main byte then a sub byte.",
