        "Piano",
        "Keys",
        "Organ",
        "Guitar",
        "Bass",
        "String",
        "Brass",
        "SaxWW",
        "SynLd",
        "Pads",
        "SyCmp",
        "CPerc",
        "Dr/Pc",
        "S.EFX",
        "M.EFX",
        "Ethnic",
        "NoAsg"
      ],
      "mainSource": "Yamaha's own notes column in the VOICE NORMAL sheet ('Pn, Kb, Or, Gt, Bs, St, Br, SW, Ld, Pd, Sc, Cp, Dr, Se, Me, Et, --'). Value 16 (NoAsg) means no assignment, and is what a voice's Category 2 holds when it has only one.",
